    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc4b <strong>Welcome to <i>Atlas Technology</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Code: Loopbreaker</i>, you play as <strong>Ethan Brooks</strong>, a <i>low-level IT support technician</i> at <strong>Atlas Technology</strong> \u2014 a tech company with <i>more ambition than regard for public holidays</i>. It's early, you're hungover, and your department supervisor wakes you up with an <strong>urgent call</strong>: one of the office computers is malfunctioning, and they need you to check it out <i><strong>now</strong></i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You head to the empty building expecting a <i>quick, uneventful fix</i>. But everything changes when a <strong>sudden tremor</strong> shakes the facility and turns your routine task into a <i><strong>sci-fi nightmare</strong></i>. <strong>Doors lock</strong>, systems go unresponsive, and the environment begins to feel like a carefully designed trap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What really happened?</strong><br><strong>Where does Ethan fit into all of this?</strong><br>And the most unsettling question:<strong> <i>Where exactly are you trapped\u2026 and why?</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Logical Puzzles and Environmental Interaction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you make your way through the <strong>offices and labs</strong> of Atlas Technology, you\u2019ll encounter <strong>locked doors</strong>, <strong>encrypted codes</strong>, and <strong>secured terminals</strong> that test your <i>observation skills</i> and <i>logical thinking</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each room presents a <strong>different kind of challenge</strong> \u2014 from <i>visual puzzles</i> to <i>deduction-based tasks</i> involving notes, documents, or clues hidden in the environment. You\u2019ll need to <strong>inspect a wide variety of objects</strong> and search for hints in <i>unexpected places</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you ever feel stuck, a <strong>hint system</strong> is available from the <strong>pause menu</strong>, offering guidance <i>without giving the solution away</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f <strong>Environmental Storytelling and Detailed Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Code: Loopbreaker</i> lets you <strong>uncover the story</strong> piece by piece. Every <strong>workstation</strong>, <strong>abandoned desk</strong>, or <strong>unread message</strong> on a terminal reveals something about the <i>people working at Atlas Technology</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll come to know several characters <strong>indirectly</strong> \u2014 piecing together fragments of their <i>routines</i>, <i>conflicts</i>, and <i>responsibilities</i>. While they may not be physically present, their <strong>presence is felt</strong> in every corner. The story unfolds through these traces, with the <strong>central mystery</strong> revolving around your own experience:<br><i><strong>What happened to you?</strong></i><br><i><strong>Why are you trapped?</strong></i><br><i><strong>And is there a way to undo it?</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person escape room</strong> with a strong <i>narrative sci-fi focus</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles built around <strong>logic</strong>, <strong>observation</strong>, and <strong>interpretation</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental storytelling</strong>: uncover the backstory of Atlas Technology and its employees through their <strong>workspaces</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interaction with <strong>terminals</strong>, <strong>object inspection</strong>, and <strong>in-game documents</strong> that add depth to the experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional <strong>hint system</strong> available via the <strong>pause menu</strong> \u2014 helpful for getting unstuck without breaking immersion</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc4b <strong>Welcome to <i>Atlas Technology</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Code: Loopbreaker</i>, you play as <strong>Ethan Brooks</strong>, a <i>low-level IT support technician</i> at <strong>Atlas Technology</strong> \u2014 a tech company with <i>more ambition than regard for public holidays</i>. It's early, you're hungover, and your department supervisor wakes you up with an <strong>urgent call</strong>: one of the office computers is malfunctioning, and they need you to check it out <i><strong>now</strong></i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You head to the empty building expecting a <i>quick, uneventful fix</i>. But everything changes when a <strong>sudden tremor</strong> shakes the facility and turns your routine task into a <i><strong>sci-fi nightmare</strong></i>. <strong>Doors lock</strong>, systems go unresponsive, and the environment begins to feel like a carefully designed trap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What really happened?</strong><br><strong>Where does Ethan fit into all of this?</strong><br>And the most unsettling question:<strong> <i>Where exactly are you trapped\u2026 and why?</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Logical Puzzles and Environmental Interaction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you make your way through the <strong>offices and labs</strong> of Atlas Technology, you\u2019ll encounter <strong>locked doors</strong>, <strong>encrypted codes</strong>, and <strong>secured terminals</strong> that test your <i>observation skills</i> and <i>logical thinking</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each room presents a <strong>different kind of challenge</strong> \u2014 from <i>visual puzzles</i> to <i>deduction-based tasks</i> involving notes, documents, or clues hidden in the environment. You\u2019ll need to <strong>inspect a wide variety of objects</strong> and search for hints in <i>unexpected places</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you ever feel stuck, a <strong>hint system</strong> is available from the <strong>pause menu</strong>, offering guidance <i>without giving the solution away</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f <strong>Environmental Storytelling and Detailed Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Code: Loopbreaker</i> lets you <strong>uncover the story</strong> piece by piece. Every <strong>workstation</strong>, <strong>abandoned desk</strong>, or <strong>unread message</strong> on a terminal reveals something about the <i>people working at Atlas Technology</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll come to know several characters <strong>indirectly</strong> \u2014 piecing together fragments of their <i>routines</i>, <i>conflicts</i>, and <i>responsibilities</i>. While they may not be physically present, their <strong>presence is felt</strong> in every corner. The story unfolds through these traces, with the <strong>central mystery</strong> revolving around your own experience:<br><i><strong>What happened to you?</strong></i><br><i><strong>Why are you trapped?</strong></i><br><i><strong>And is there a way to undo it?</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person escape room</strong> with a strong <i>narrative sci-fi focus</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles built around <strong>logic</strong>, <strong>observation</strong>, and <strong>interpretation</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental storytelling</strong>: uncover the backstory of Atlas Technology and its employees through their <strong>workspaces</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interaction with <strong>terminals</strong>, <strong>object inspection</strong>, and <strong>in-game documents</strong> that add depth to the experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional <strong>hint system</strong> available via the <strong>pause menu</strong> \u2014 helpful for getting unstuck without breaking immersion</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Help Ethan in this first-person puzzle adventure. Immerse yourself in Atlas Technology, a dark tech company brimming with enigmas and an absurd amount of corporate shenanigans. Solve riddles, investigate clues, and uncover hidden secrets in a sci-fi story. Will you escape a fateful ending?",
